=2 Walkthrough
After completing the previous quest and zoning out and back into {z:Ru'Lude Gardens}, speak to {n:Anastase} and select the first option to expand the warp options.
At this point, you must discover eleven {p:Geomagnetic Founts|Geomagnetic Fount} hidden throughout Vana'diel by using the hints provided upon asking Anastase about his predictions:
|^Location Name|Details
|Green Light|"A green light at the end of a dark prison" {br}{z:West Ronfaure} (E-8) - must travel through {z:Bostaunieux Oubliette} to reach the fount. (900 EXP){br} Using the Unity warp (content level 122) places you directly beside the zone entrance. Avoid dropping down after zoning out.
|Clear Waters|"A roaring dragon bound for clear waters" {br}{z:North Gustaberg} (D-8) - must travel through {z:Dangruf Wadi} to reach the fount. It is on the north side of the river near the entrance on a rock. (750 EXP){br} (Optional) There is a {p:Stone Monument} for the quest {q:An Explorer's Footsteps|An Explorer's Footsteps|An Explorer's Footsteps} if you continue heading east into the cave at the end of the path.
|Crowned Tower|"A tower crowned with the name of an orchid" {br}{z:West Sarutabaruta} (F-4) - At the entrance of the {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins}, located on the platform above the staircase leading down into the ruins. (320 EXP){br} Taking the survival guide will cut the distance in half compared to leaving from Windurst.
|Deep Cliffs|"The depths of cliffs that cleave plains in twain" {br}{z:La Theine Plateau} (H-10), inside the valley, just outside the exit from {z:Ordelle's Caves}. You need to run through the caves and exit near Morbolger. (600 EXP){br} (Optional) There is a {p:Cermet Headstone} containing the {@k} {k:Water fragment} for {M:Zilart Mission 5|Zilart Mission 5|Headstone Pilgrimage} if you continue going southwest to the end of the chasm.
|Windmill|"The power to run through a windmill-dotted land" {br}{z:Konschtat Highlands} (L-5) - must walk across the spine to reach the fount. (500 EXP){br} Taking the survival guide to {z:Gusgen Mines} will get you there quickly.
|Dust Cloud|"The foot of a precipice where dust clouds rage" {br}{z:Tahrongi Canyon} (I-9) - It's between a rock formation and the east wall. (500 EXP){br} The {z:Buburimu Peninsula} survival guide will get you close.
|Lakeside|"Crimson shears sleeping by a forested lakeside" {br}{z:Jugner Forest} (G-5) - must travel through {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}. (750 EXP)
|Swamps|"Ceaseless raindrops in swampy land" {br}{z:Pashhow Marshlands} (I-7) - SE corner, next to the Luremarsh in a puddle. (500 EXP)
|Backbone|"A mountain range where dragon bones form an arc" {br}{z:Meriphataud Mountains} (G-8) - NE corner of Square (500 EXP)
|Crags|"Gigantic crags where undying feathers rain down" {br}{z:Attohwa Chasm} (J-8) - At the top of {p:Parradamo Tor}. (900 EXP)
|Silver|"A corridor hidden by a silver shield" {br}{z:Uleguerand Range} (H-7) - At the top of the mountain, on the trail behind the Ice Waterfall that disappears when no weather is present. It is located directly next to Home Point Crystal #1 (2000 EXP)

After attuning the {k:Prototype attuner} to each of the 11 geomagnetic founts above, return to {n:Anastase} to complete the quest.
